Subject: CPMS I02 Activation Data Design

@ [design_uuid] efa4b598-562e-4ed9-a519-a460188cee6c

& [FeatureGraph] is two nodes
  + cantor_core/json-schema activates only dep:schemars
  + cantor_procedure_tool/json-schema activates dep:schemars and cantor_core/json-schema

& [DeriveMarker] is conditional
  + cfg_attr feature json-schema derive schemars JsonSchema
  + procedure closed-enum macro carries one conditional derive expression for its 17 emitted types
  + all other reachable forms carry their own conditional derive marker

& [SemanticIdSchema] is string constrained
  + minimum length 1
  + maximum length 512
  + pattern admits only ASCII alphanumeric underscore hyphen period colon and slash

& [FocusedProof] compiles roots
  + input Deserialize contract: PrepareRequest, PreparedRunRequest, VerifyRequest
  + output Serialize contract: ProcedureToolResponse
  + crossing PreparedRunRequest is compiled under both contracts
  + recursive ProcedureType and ProcedureValue schemas terminate through local definitions

